{"ticker":"DVA","updated":"2026-10-23T23:45:19Z","profile":{"longName":"DaVita Inc.","shortName":"DaVita Inc.","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Care Facilities","country":"United States","website":"https://www.davita.com","fullTimeEmployees":78000,"marketCap":11716232192,"trailingPE":15.510135,"forwardPE":10.711882,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.8362975,"pegRatio":0.46,"targetMeanPrice":219.85715,"targetHighPrice":270.0,"targetLowPrice":165.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":7,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.052,"earningsGrowth":0.558,"grossMargins":0.32364,"operatingMargins":0.16061,"profitMargins":0.060489997,"totalRevenue":14009646080,"beta":0.795,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":247.49,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":101.0,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"DaVita Inc. provides kidney dialysis services for patients suffering from chronic kidney failure in the United States. The company operates kidney dialysis centers and provides related lab services in outpatient dialysis centers. It also offers outpatient, hospital inpatient, and home-based hemodialysis dialysis services; operates clinical laboratories that provide routine laboratory tests for dialysis and other physician-prescribed laboratory tests for ESRD patients; and management and administrative services to outpatient dialysis centers. In addition, the company offers integrated care and disease management services to patients in risk-based and other integrated care arrangements; clinical research programs; physician services; and comprehensive kidney care services. Further, it engages in the transplant software business. The company was formerly known as DaVita HealthCare Partners Inc. and changed its name to DaVita Inc. in September 2016. DaVita Inc. was incorporated in 1994 and is headquartered in Denver, Colorado.","summary_zh":"DaVita Inc.為美國慢性腎衰竭患者提供腎臟透析服務。該公司經營腎臟透析中心，並在門診透析中心提供相關實驗室服務。它還提供門診、醫院住院和家庭血液透析透析服務；營運臨床實驗室，為末期腎病患者提供透析常規實驗室測試和其他醫生規定的實驗室測試；以及門診透析中心的管理和行政服務。此外，該公司還透過基於風險的綜合護理安排和其他綜合護理安排為患者提供全面護理和疾病管理服務；臨床研究計劃；醫生服務；和全面的腎臟護理服務。此外，它還從事移植軟體業務。該公司前身為 DaVita HealthCare Partners Inc.，於 2016 年 9 月更名為 DaVita Inc.。 DaVita Inc. 成立於 1994 年，總部位於科羅拉多州丹佛市。","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"醫療設施","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":139.77,"h":141.0,"l":137.28,"c":137.33,"v":561100},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":137.34,"h":138.97,"l":136.33,"c":138.68,"v":951900},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":138.93,"h":139.65,"l":137.51,"c":137.56,"v":506700},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":137.97,"h":138.05,"l":134.71,"c":136.03,"v":990200},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":136.08,"h":137.77,"l":135.74,"c":137.76,"v":531300},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":136.46,"h":137.0,"l":135.01,"c":136.95,"v":1039400},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":136.66,"h":137.29,"l":135.33,"c":135.97,"v":583900},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":136.14,"h":137.06,"l":135.04,"c":135.56,"v":797900},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":135.5,"h":138.37,"l":135.5,"c":137.87,"v":660000},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":136.99,"h":136.99,"l":133.57,"c":134.51,"v":882300},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":134.52,"h":137.58,"l":133.74,"c":136.71,"v":715000},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":135.81,"h":136.4,"l":131.77,"c":132.26,"v":605100},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":133.17,"h":134.48,"l":132.76,"c":133.24,"v":728900},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":133.0,"h":133.94,"l":132.08,"c":133.17,"v":481700},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":133.17,"h":133.54,"l":130.45,"c":130.95,"v":633300},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":131.31,"h":131.31,"l":129.66,"c":130.11,"v":738100},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":130.7,"h":131.34,"l":127.55,"c":128.0,"v":1387400},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":127.95,"h":130.75,"l":126.95,"c":130.23,"v":704800},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":130.22,"h":131.17,"l":129.78,"c":130.16,"v":3137200},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":130.06,"h":131.68,"l":129.44,"c":131.15,"v":773800},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":131.22,"h":134.01,"l":131.22,"c":132.83,"v":677700},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":132.06,"h":134.34,"l":131.32,"c":133.62,"v":530900},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":133.42,"h":133.8,"l":129.73,"c":130.27,"v":591500},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":131.06,"h":131.74,"l":130.48,"c":130