pa0Z3QUFMSWFOMWdJdEg1WWlkTlBORGRNVGR2dG5VZjZaVTNjNWxyR3gtU1dlNlhxVnFySklQTzFkc2xkWDRKbEwwcU1Xa2xvSnotUWZlRm0tS3JkcjN0YkZ5cDdtUE01QWdGNFNzVVpWVkxQSjRDamh3dWJJcHp2LWpMSUJvWXE1V1FkaEhEVXpYZTF3aWc?oc=5","date":"2026-10-21","zh":"Elara 關懷委員會主席 Paul Kusserow：更多付款人將購買臨終關懷、家庭健康服務"},{"title":"Outpatient & specialty care stocks Q2 teardown: DaVita (NYSE:DVA) vs the rest","src":"StockStory","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxPNi1XeWxoZHA1TzhFUGxDb2tyRERZdDU4Rnd5N0tPV2puUDF4QWhJbEZiZ1hjWmtWam9Vam1SVFpwQ2Nhbkl3ZUgwR2dlVjRnaDJFZXZ3UThGaVNSYktOMlltRWdBa0REQlVsUXU0NERYbkpMN2thaTQ2dHNINDNRLTNfZ25tRmdWRVk0bjhJU1VrNEo3NmRQV29BM0ZKWHE3aHRsdFNwQm9tQnFrdm9kYlk4MmpoUzRDT0VpeTN0ejk0YkpUMVNKbEh1MA?oc=5","date":"2026-10-21","zh":"門診和專業護理股票第二季拆解：DaVita（NYSE：DVA）與其他股票"},{"title":"Barclays Maintains DaVita(DVA.US) With Hold Rating, Maintains Target Price $224","src":"Moomoo","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxOd3A4S2dCR3ZJQzd2YU1Xd3lONHRWVWtoaFBwYTdRQ0E1NlB5Tm1nUE5vMzNuZ2NXdWhpSS1aRldXOE9FU0tBdENvUlpBNmNqMGhMUXBmUHR2dWxzWlRJd0tmV0ctXzdGVl9kWTAtUGl6WWNhZkJkeDhSRjVGNXp0UGw1VjJ1TWU1ak56YW10Mjg4NU5mX1dpMFgtZGdGTnNjQW5JR1dhNzZVUXQzSUh6UTVPOTJkdw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-21","zh":"巴克萊維持 DaVita(DVA.US) 持有評級，維持目標價 224 美元"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":3},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2},{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-11","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/927066/000092706626000012/dva-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"DaVita is a leading healthcare provider focused on transforming care delivery to improve quality of life for patients globally. As a comprehensive kidney care provider, we have been a leader in clinical quality and innovation for more than 25 years. We care for patients at every stage and setting along their kidney health journey–from slowing the progression of kidney disease to helping support transplantation. This includes ensuring they are supported at home, in our dialysis centers, in the hospital and in skilled nursing facilities. In our unwavering pursuit of a healthier tomorrow, we strive to reimagine what high quality care looks like: more preventative, better integrated, improved outcomes at the lowest total cost, and personalized at scale to deliver a better tomorrow regardless of location, insurance status or other factors. Our caring culture fuels our continuous drive toward ","zh":"DaVita 是一家領先的醫療保健提供者，致力於改變護理服務以提高全球患者的生活品質。作為一家綜合腎臟護理提供者，25 年來我們一直是臨床品質和創新領域的領導者。我們在患者腎臟健康之旅的各個階段和環境中為患者提供護理——從減緩腎臟疾病的進展到幫助支持移植。這包括確保他們在家中、我們的透析中心、醫院和熟練的護理機構得到支援。在我們堅定不移地追求更健康的明天的過程中，我們努力重新構想高品質護理的樣子：更具預防性、更好的綜合性、以最低的總成本改善結果，以及大規模個性化，以提供更美好的明天，無論地點、保險狀況或其他因素如何。我們的關懷文化推動我們不斷努力"},{"en":"There are five stages of chronic kidney disease (CKD). These stages are generally based on how well the kidneys work to filter waste and extra fluid out of the blood–with higher stages of CKD corresponding to progressing levels of kidney disease. Stage 1 CKD is the closest to healthy kidney function. Stage 5 CKD indicates that a patient has severe kidney damage.","zh":"慢性腎臟病（CKD）有五個階段。這些階段通常取決於腎臟過濾血液中廢物和多餘液體的能力，CKD 的較高階段對應於腎臟疾病的進展程度。第一階段 CKD 最接近健康的腎功能。 5 期 CKD 表示患者有嚴重的腎臟損傷。"},{"en":"A patient diagnosed with Stage 5 CKD has kidneys that have lost nearly all functionality or have failed. If an individual's kidneys fail, the person is then diagnosed with end stage renal disease (ESRD), also known as end stage kidney disease (ESKD). Because kidney function is essential for survival and the loss of kidney function is normally irreversible, ESKD patients require continued dialysis treatments or a kidney transplant to sustain life. Dialysis is the removal of toxins, fluids and salt from the blood of patients by artificial means. Patients suffering from ESKD generally require regular life-sustaining dialysis therapy for the rest of their lives or until they receive a kidney transplant.","zh":"被診斷為 5 期 CKD 的患者的腎臟幾乎喪失了所有功能或已經衰竭。如果一個人的腎臟衰竭，該人就會被診斷為末期腎病 (ESRD)，也稱為末期腎病 (ESKD)。由於腎功能對於生存至關重要，而腎功能的喪失通常是不可逆的，因此 ESKD 患者需要持續的透析治療或腎臟移植來維持生命。透析是透過人工手段去除患者血液中的毒素、液體和鹽分。患有 ESKD 的患者通常需要在餘生或直到接受腎臟移植之前定期進行維持生命的透析治療。"}],"markets":[{"en":"We are a leading dialysis provider in the United States. Our U.S. dialysis and related lab services (U.S. dialysis) business treats patients with chronic kidney failure, ESKD, in the United States, and is our largest line of business. Our robust platform to deliver kidney care services also includes established nephrology and payor relationships.","zh":"我們是美國領先的透析提供者。我們的美國透析和相關實驗室服務（美國透析）業務在美國治療慢性腎衰竭 (ESKD) 患者，是我們最大的業務線。我們提供腎臟護理服務的強大平台還包括已建立的腎臟病學和付款人關係。"},{"en":"In addition, as of December 31, 2025, our international operations provided dialysis and administrative services to a total of 585 outpatient dialysis centers located in 14 countries outside of the U.S., serving approximately 94,500 patients.","zh":"此外，截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們的國際業務為美國以外 14 個國家的總共 585 個門診透析中心提供透析和管理服務，為約 94,500 名患者提供服務。"}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The U.S. dialysis industry remains highly competitive and is continuously evolving. New and emerging entrants have been entering the kidney healthcare business space and the industry continues to experience pricing and costs pressures, regulatory changes, challenging labor market conditions and ongoing developments in new technologies, treatments and therapies, among other things. In most of the geographical areas in which we operate, there are other facilities that provide dialysis services to those offered by our facilities. In addition, in some markets, some competitors may have greater financial resources, may be better equipped, and may offer a broader range of services than us. Some competitors, including our largest competitor, Fresenius Medical Care, also manufacture their own supplies and equipment, in addition to owning and operating outpatient dialysis centers worldwide, which","zh":"美國透析產業仍然保持高度競爭並不斷發展。新的和新興的進入者已經進入腎臟保健業務領域，該行業繼續面臨定價和成本壓力、監管變化、充滿挑戰的勞動力市場條件以及新技術、治療方法和療法的持續發展等。在我們經營所在的大多數地理區域，還有其他設施為我們設施提供的透析服務提供透析服務。此外，在某些市場上，有些競爭對手可能比我們擁有更多的財力，可能裝備更好，並且可能提供更廣泛的服務。一些競爭對手，包括我們最大的競爭對手 Fresenius Medical Care，除了在全球擁有和經營門診透析中心外，還製造自己的用品和設備，這"},{"en":"In our U.S. dialysis business, we continue to face competition from large and medium-sized providers, among others, which compete directly with us for limited acquisition targets, for individual patients who may choose to dialyze with us and to engage physicians qualified to provide required medical director services. In addition to these large and medium sized dialysis providers with substantial financial resources and other established participants in the dialysis space, we also compete with new dialysis providers, private equity-backed kidney care providers, individual nephrologists and former medical directors or physicians that have opened their own dialysis units or facilities. Moreover, as we continue our international dialysis expansion into various international markets, we face competition from large and medium-sized providers, among others, for acquisition targets as well as p","zh":"在我們的美國透析業務中，我們繼續面臨來自大中型供應商等的競爭，這些供應商直接與我們競爭有限的收購目標，針對可能選擇與我們進行透析的個人患者，並聘請有資格提供所需醫療主任服務的醫生。除了這些擁有大量財力的大中型透析提供者和透析領域的其他老牌參與者之外，我們還與新的透析提供者、私募股權支持的腎臟護理提供者、個體腎臟病學家以及開設了自己的透析單位或設施的前醫療主任或醫生競爭。此外，隨著我們繼續向各個國際市場進行國際透析擴張，我們面臨來自大中型供應商等的競爭，包括收購目標以及產品供應。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US Dialysis & Related Lab Services","val":11731986000,"zh":"美國透析及相關實驗室服務"},{"name":"All Other Segments","val":1911083000,"zh":"所有其他部門"}],"total":13643069000}},"peers":["MCO","UHS","DGX","LH","HCA"]}}